Processing.R <https://github.com/gaocegege/Processing.R> is the R mode for Processing, and it uses renjin to interpret  R code in JVM. Now the new mode is available in Processing:

 <https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-2TSWI2nvCQk/WZZlX-jVToI/AAAAAAAAAHw/2K3ohEjmTosTJKWcpN_Pi9g0SKpFxeMjQCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E6%258D%2595%25E8%258E%25B7.PNG>

Welcome to have a try :)

